  "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(comments): spend TikTok and Instagram comment calls on posts the report keeps by @mvanhorn in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1554\n* feat(tiktok): free top comments for every kept TikTok from the public comment endpoint by @mvanhorn in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1555\n* feat(library): silent multi-harness finished-brief capture and offline transcript harvest by @mvanhorn in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1556\n* feat(shortform): keyless TikTok/Instagram fallback via web discovery + yt-dlp by @grain-lu in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1533\n* chore(release): bump version to 4.6.0 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1559\n\n## New Contributors\n* @grain-lu made their first contribution in https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/pull/1533\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/mvanhorn/last30days-skill/compare/v4.5.0...v4.6.0",
